<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mpetaji</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mpetaji</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mpetaji</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mpet</para>
  <para style="mt">Mpetaji</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Mpetaji chofundiza ubala wa kukala goya. Mbuli ya Chiebulania yoisang'haniligwe fana zina da chitabu chino ina fambulo da “yeye yowaduganya wanhu.” Wasomi wengi wogesa kuwa mfalume Sulemani niiyo yandike chitabu chino cha Mpetaji, mbali iviya wauko wamwenga hawatogola mbuli iyo. One chitabu chino chandikigwa na mfalume Sulemani, chizakuwa chandikigwa hagati ya mwaka 970 na 931 KK, kwaviya miyaka iyo mfalume Sulemani kakala mgima. Wasomi hawatogola mbuli iyo wogesa kuwa chitabu chino chandikigwa hagati ya mwaka 400 na 200 KK.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Mpetaji chokwandusa kwa kulonga kuwa chila chinhu hano hana isi chilinga fana mbeho ifosa na kwaga himahima (sula ya 1:14). Ino yofambula kuwa ugima wetu na sang'hano zetu vofosa, iviya chitabu cha Mpetaji cholagusa kuwa vidala kuzimanya mbuli za ugima wetu. Vinhu vingi kusonhela ugima wetu na sang'hano zetu havikawa kuzimizigwa. Muna ichitabu chino choifunza kuwa cheye wenyewo hachidaha kutawala ugima wetu na sang'hano zetu. Muhavu utogole ugima fana viwili na udeng'helele chinhu chiulinacho (sula ya 9:9). Kuuhelelo mwandikaji kogesa chinhu chifaya ng'hani ni kumdumba Mulungu na kuzindilila malagilizo yake (sula ya 12:13).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1:1-11 yomulagusa mwandikaji kofambula kusonhela ugima wake.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 1:12 mbaka sula ya 6:9 zofambula ugima.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula ya 6:10 mbaka sula ya 12:8 zofambula ubala wa mpetaji.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Sula ya 12:9-14 yogotola kwa kulonga kuwa lungilo da ugima ni kumdumba Mulungu na kuzindilila malagilizo yake.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s">Ugima wokwazaganya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Zino mbuli za mpetaji mwanage Daudi yakalile mfalume uko Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ECC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />Mpetaji kolonga, “Mbuli zose zokwazaganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:2">mbuli zose zokwazaganya ng'hani!”<verse eid="ECC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />Vino wanhu wezamweda choni kwa sang'hano ziwosang'hana muna iisi?<verse eid="ECC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Wanhu wamwenga wodanganika na wanhu wamwenga wovumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:4">mbali isi yosigala siku zose.<verse eid="ECC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Zuwa dolawa na doswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:5">dolopola kulawa kaidi.<verse eid="ECC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Beho dobuma kulawa ubanzi wa kusi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:6">dozunguluka kuhita ubanzi wa kasikazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:6">Beho dogendelela kuzunguluka.<verse eid="ECC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Mazi ya nyanda zose yokilimila muna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:7">mbali bahali haifakuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:7">Hanhu zinyanda hozandusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:7">niuko mazi koyobwela kaidi.<verse eid="ECC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Mbuli zose zolegeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:8">hazidahika kusimulila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:8">Meso ya wanhu hayeguta kulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:8">na magutwi hayeguta kuhulika.<verse eid="ECC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />Vinhu vikalile uko niivo vondavilawilile kaidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:9">Mbuli zitendeke niizo zondazitendeke kaidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:9">Habule mbuli yondaiwe ngeni muna iisi.<verse eid="ECC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Wanhu wolonga, “Lola mbuli ngeni.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:10">Mbali itendeka umwaka ng'hani.<verse eid="ECC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />Wanhu hawakumbuka mbuli za umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:11">na wanhu wa hamwande hawezakumbuka mbuli za sambi.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubala na ubozi vokwazaganya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Niye mpetaji vinikalile mfalume wa Isilaili uko Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />niiyoha kupelemba na kuzahila kwa ubala chila chinhu chilawilile muna iisi. Niwona Mulungu viyawagazile wanhu ng'hani. <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Niziwona mbuli zose zitendigwa muna iisi. Mbuli zose zokwazaganya na zilinga fana munhu yoilunga kugwila mbeho. <verse eid="ECC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Wanhu wolonga, “Chinhu chikong'honyale hachidaha kugolosigwa, chilihabule hachidaha kupetigwa.” <verse eid="ECC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />Nigesa, “Niipatila ubala mkulu ng'hani kufosa wanhu wose wanilongolele kutawala Yelusalemu. Nipata kuzowela na ubala na umanyi.”<verse eid="ECC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Baho niiyoha kuvimanya ubala na ubozi, mbali niwona mbuli ino iviya ilinga fana kugwila mbeho. <verse eid="ECC 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Lekamana wanhu wolonga, “Ubala wogala giyogiyo, na munhu yokongeza umanyi ng'hani kokongeza lugano.”<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="s">Kudeng'helela vinhu kokwazaganya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Maabaho nigesa, “Leka nitende madambwa muladi niideng'heleze.” Mbali niwona kuwa kutenda ivo kokwazaganya. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" />Nilonga, “Seko ni ubozi. Vino madambwa yonitaza choni?” <verse eid="ECC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Nigesa ng'hani vondanilusangalaze lukuli lwangu kwa divai kuno ning'hali nzewele zangu zonilanguliza kwa ubala na kutenda fana wabozi viwotenda muladi niwone chinhu chilihi chinogile kwa wanhu kutenda viwokala lusita luguhi muna iisi.<verse eid="ECC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />Nitenda mbuli ng'hulu, niizengela kaye na nihanda mizabibu muna imigunda. <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />Nilima migunda na vizi. Nihanda mibiki ya matunda ya mbasakanyo muna imigunda iyo. <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />Nihimbila malamba ya kuigumila mazi mibiki iyo. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" />Nigula watumwa wa chilume na nigula watumwa wa chike na watumwa wamwenga welekigwa muna ikaye yangu. Nikala na ng'hondolo wengi na ng'ombe wengi kufosa munhu yoyose yakalile Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" />Niikila hela na zahabu na nilihigwa kulawa muna ingama ya wafalume na muna iisi, nipata wembaji wa chilume na wembaji wa chike. Iviya nipata wake womeleligwa mate na walume.<verse eid="ECC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />Nikala mkulu kufosa wose wanilongolele kukala muna dibululu da Yelusalemu. Lusita ulo lose nikala na ubala. <verse eid="ECC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Chila chinhu chinimelele mate nichipata. Siukimilile moyo wangu kupata chochose chonimelele mate. Nideng'helela kusang'hana sang'hano zangu zose na mbuli iyo ikala gweko jangu. <verse eid="ECC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Maabaho nigesa sang'hano zose zonisang'hane kwa makono yangu na viya vinilavile vuke vinikalile notenda ivo. Niwona kuwa mbuli izo zose zikala zokwazaganya na zilinga fana munhu yogwila mbeho, mbali hadaha.<verse eid="ECC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukala kwa ubala kokwazaganya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Maabaho nyandusa kugesa fambulo da ubala na chichala na ubozi. Niiuzagiza, “Mfalume wa sambi kodaha kutenda choni?” Kezatenda fana viyatendile mfalume yamulongolele kutawala. <verse eid="ECC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Niwona kuwa ubala unoga kufosa ubozi, fana bung'hulo vidinogile kufosa ziza. <verse eid="ECC 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Munhu mbala kowona kuyohita mbali mbozi kogenda muna diziza. Mbali nivimanya kuwa munhu mbala na mbozi uhelelo wawo umwe. <verse eid="ECC 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Maabaho nigesa, “Mbozi kezadanganika na niye nizadanganika, lelo habali niwa mbala fana vino?” Nigesa, “Mbuli izo zose zokwazaganya.” <verse eid="ECC 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Habule yomkumbuka munhu yeli na ubala hebu munhu mbozi, kwaviya siku zikwiza wose wezazimizigwa. Mbala na mbozi wose wodanganika.<verse eid="ECC 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusang'hana usang'hano kokwazaganya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Ivo niwihila ugima wangu, kwaviya sang'hano zose zisang'hanigwa muna iisi zinhesa. Sang'hano zose zokwazaganya na zilinga fana munhu yogwila mbeho. <verse eid="ECC 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Nizihila sang'hano ndala zose zonisang'hane kwa kuiyoha hano hana iisi, kwaviya nolondeka nimulekele munhu yondayanihazi. <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />Vino yelihi yovimanya kezakuwa mbala hebu mbozi? Mbali yeye kezahazi vinhu vose vonipatile kwa kusang'hanila ubala wangu hano hana iisi. Iviya mbuli izo zose zokwazaganya. <verse eid="ECC 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Ivo vinigesile kaidi sang'hano ndala zinisang'hane hano hana iisi, nifa moyo.<verse eid="ECC 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />Wanhu wosang'hana usang'hano kwa ufundi na ubala na umanyi, mbali wolondeka vinhu vawo vose wawalekele wanhu hawavigaiye. Mbuli izo zose zokwazaganya na ziha ng'hani. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Vino wanhu wopata choni kwa sang'hano zawo zose na kusafagila ng'hani muna zisang'hano ziwogaiya hano hana iisi? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" />Sang'hano zawo za siku zose zina mawine na manyulunyulu, nzewele zawo ichilo hazihumula kugesa. Mbuli izo zose zokwazaganya.<verse eid="ECC 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />Habule chinhu chowotenda wanhu chinogile kutenda, mbali kuja na kung'wa na kudeng'helela sang'hano zawo. Nizimanya mbuli izo zilawa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />Mulungu iyo yoching'ha ndiya na usang'hano wa kudeng'helela. <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" />Mulungu komwing'ha umanyi na ubala na deng'ho munhu yomnogeza, mbali komwing'ha muhasanyi usang'hano wa kuduganya vinhu vingi na kwika ngama. Mulungu komwing'ha vinhu ivo munhu yomnogeza. Iviya mbuli izo zokwazaganya na zilinga fana munhu yogwila mbeho.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s">Chila mbuli na lusita lwake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Chila mbuli ina lusita lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:1">chila mbuli muna iisi ina siku yake,<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />lusita lwa kuvumbuka na lusita lwa kudanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:2">lusita lwa kuhanda na lusita lwa kugobola,<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />lusita lwa kukoma na lusita lwa kuhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:3">lusita lwa kubomola na lusita lwa kuzenga,<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />lusita lwa kulila na lusita lwa kuseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:4">lusita lwa usungu na lusita lwa kuvina,<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />lusita lwa kupwililisa mabwe na lusita lwa kukunzagiza mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:5">lusita lwa kuhagatila na lusita lwa kuleka kuhagatila,<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />lusita lwa kuzahila chinhu na lusita lwa kuleka kuzahila chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:6">lusita lwa kwika chinhu na lusita lwa kwasa chinhu,<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />lusita lwa kudega na lusita lwa kusona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:7">lusita lwa kunyamala na lusita lwa kulonga,<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />lusita lwa kulonda na lusita lwa kwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:8">lusita lwa ng'hondo na lusita lwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />Vino sang'hano ya wanhu yowafaya choni? <verse eid="ECC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Niye niwona sang'hano ziya zoweng'higwe wanhu na Mulungu. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />Mulungu kachitenda chila chinhu chinoge kwa lusita lwake, iviya kaweng'ha wanhu hamu ya kuvimanya mbuli zose zikwiza, mbali wanhu hawadaha kuvimanya mwanduso na uhelelo wa sang'hano za Mulungu. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Nivimanya kuwa kwa wanhu kuna mbuli imwe muhala ifaya, kudeng'helela na kusangalala lusita lwa ugima wawo. <verse eid="ECC 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />Wanhu wose waje na wang'we na wadeng'helele sang'hano zawo. Mbuli izo ni gweko dilawa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ECC 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Novimanya kuwa chochose choyotenda Mulungu chizakala siku zose na habule munhu yodaha kongeza hebu kuhunguza. Mulungu kotenda ivo muladi wanhu wamdumbe yeye. <verse eid="ECC 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Chinhu chili muna iisi chikala uko umwaka na chondachilawilile hamwande chikala uko umwaka na Mulungu kochitenda chinhu icho chibwelele kulawilila.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wose wezahumizigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Iviya niwona chinhu chimwenga muna iisi kuwa, hanhu ha kuhumizila wabaho wihi, na hanhu ha kuhumizila voilondeka wabaho wihi. <verse eid="ECC 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Maabaho nigesa, “Mulungu kezahumiza wanhu wose wotenda mbuli zinogile na wotenda mbuli zihile.” Kwaviya kwizakuwa na lusita lwa chila mbuli na lusita lwa kuhumiza chila sang'hano.<verse eid="ECC 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Iviya nigesa, “Mulungu kowageza wanhu muladi waiwone wawo walinga fana wanyama. <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" />Uhelelo wa wanhu na uhelelo wa wanyama umwe, viya viwofa wanhu ivo viwofa wanyama. Wose wana mhumuzi. Wanhu na wanyama wose wezakufa, wose walinga fana yosi dikwaga. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Wose wohita hanhu hamwe. Wose wolawa muulongo na wobwela kaidi muulongo. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Vino yelihi yovimanya muhe wa munhu wohita kuchanyha na muhe wa mnyama wohumuluka hasi?”<verse eid="ECC 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Ivo niwona kuwa habule chinhu chinogile ng'hani kwa wanhu kufosa kudeng'helela sang'hano zawo kwaviya walungiligwa ivo. Vino yelihi yodaha kuwalongela wanhu mbuli zondazilawilile baho vondawadanganike?<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="s">Magayo muna iisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Maabaho niwona magayo yose muna iisi. Niwona wanhu wogazigwa viwolila masozi, mbali habule munhu yowaguma moyo. Waja wowagaza wana nguvu na habule munhu wa kuwaguma moyo. <verse eid="ECC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Nigesa kuwa wanhu wadanganike wamweda kufosa wanhu wagima. <verse eid="ECC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Mbali muhavu wanhu hawanavumbuka kufosa wanhu wawo, kwaviya hawanaziwona mbuli zihile zitendeka muna iisi.<verse eid="ECC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiyoha kusang'hana sang'hano kokwazaganya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Maabaho niwona kuwa wanhu wosang'hana usang'hano kwa kuiyoha kwaviya woiwonela migongo. Mbuli zose zokwazaganya na zilinga fana munhu yogwila mbeho.<verse eid="ECC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Mbozi hatenda usang'hano, kuuhelelo koikoma na nzala.<verse eid="ECC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Muhavu kuwa na vinhu vidodo kuno moyo wako uhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:6">kufosa kuwa na vinhu vingi kuno koigaza kusang'hana sang'hano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:6">kwaviya kuiyoha kusang'hana sang'hano kulinga fana kugwila mbeho.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Maabaho niwona mbuli imwenga ya kwazaganya muna iisi. <verse eid="ECC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Munhu imwe kabule mwana hebu ndugu wa kuhazi vinhu vake, mbali koiyoha kusang'hana sang'hano na kowona vinhu vake havifaya. Yaiuzagize, “Vino nomsang'hanila yelihi na habali noikimilila sekenideng'helele?” Mbuli izo zokwazaganya na zoguma usungu.<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Muhavu kuwa waidi kufosa munhu yaidumwe, kwaviya wanhu waidi wezagwekigwa kwa sang'hano yawo. <verse eid="ECC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />One imwe wawo yahagwa, miyage komwinula. Mbali munhu yokala yaidumwe yahagwa kezagaya. Munhu iyo kabule munhu wa kumwinula. <verse eid="ECC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Iviya kuhawa na mbeho, wanhu waidi wogona hamwe wopata vuke. Vino munhu yahagona yaidumwe kezapataze vuke? <verse eid="ECC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Munhu yahawa yaidumwe kodaha kuhumigwa na mwihi, mbali wahawa waidi wezamuhuma. Nzabi nhatu zihogosigwe hamwe hazidumuka himahima.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulonda kuwa mkulu kokwazaganya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Muhavu mbwanga ngayengaye yeli mbala kufosa mfalume mulala yeli mbozi yolema kuzumigwa. <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />Yodahika mbwanga yalingile iyo kodaha kuwa mfalume hata yahalawile muna ichifungo hebu yahelekwigwe ngayengaye. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Niwawona wanhu wose wokala muna iisi wamsondelela mbwanga imwenga yondayasole ufalume. <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Peta ya wanhu haikalile na uhelelo na kawatawala wose, mbali waja welesi wa hamwande hawamnogele. Mbuli zose zokwazaganya na zilinga fana munhu yogwila mbeho.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="s">Vouilaha uiteganye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Uhengila muna ikaye ya Mulungu uiteganye. Kukwenhuka habehi kutegeleza kunoga kufosa kulava nhambiko fana wabozi weli hawavimanyile kuwa wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="ECC 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />Zigese mbuli ung'hali hunazilonga na sekeulopole kulonga mbuli yoyose haulongozi wa Mulungu, kwaviya yeye kakuulanga na weye kwamuna iisi, lelo mbuli zako zolondeka kuwa ndodo. <verse eid="ECC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Uhawa na manyulunyulu ng'hani kwizalota nzozi nyingi, uhalonga mbuli nyingi kwizalonga kwa ubozi.<verse eid="ECC 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />Uhamulaganila mbuli Mulungu kwa kuilaha, sekeukalame kuitenda, kwaviya Mulungu hanogelwa na wabozi. Tenda mbuli youilahile. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />One hudaha kufikiza mbuli youilahile kutenda, kolondeka sekeuilahe. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Sekeuleke mulomo wako ukutende uhasanye. Maabaho sekeuigombele haulongozi wa msenga wa Mulungu kwa kulonga, “Nibananga kumulahila Mulungu.” Vino habali Mulungu yakuwonele ludoko na kuzibananga sang'hano ziutenda?<verse eid="ECC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Kulota nzozi nyingi na kulonga mbuli nyingi hakufaya, ivo umdumbe Mulungu.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utajili na hishima vokwazaganya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Sekewazanywe uhawona muna iisi ngayengaye wodununzigwa na wobamanyigwa. Chila mtawala yowagaza ngayengaye kolangulizigwa na mtawala imwenga. Wawo wose wolangulizigwa na watawala wamwenga. <verse eid="ECC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Mbali mfalume yahawalongela wanhu walime, kezawafaya wanhu wose muna iisi yake.<verse eid="ECC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Munhu yolonda hela hezakwiguta hela na munhu yomelela mate vinhu one yaheng'higwa, hezakwiguta. Mbuli izo hazifaya. <verse eid="ECC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Vinhu vihongezeka na wanhu wopula wokongezeka. Hela hazizamfaya tajili kwaviya wamwenga wezazilonda. <verse eid="ECC 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Nhongo za msang'hani zinoga, one kaja chidogo hebu ng'hani, mbali tajili hadaha kugona nhongo, kwaviya vinhu viyeli navo vomgaza ichilo chose.<verse eid="ECC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Niwona mbuli ihile imwenga muna iisi, kuikila vinhu vingi hakumfaya munhu. <verse eid="ECC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />Vinhu vake vokwaga bila kuilunga na hamwande hawa na chinhu cha kuwalekela wanage. <verse eid="ECC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" />Fana viya munhu viyezile ukengele kulawa muna iinda ya mami yake, niivo vondayasegele ukengele muna iisi. Hezadaha kusola chochose muna ivinhu vake. <verse eid="ECC 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Haifaya munhu kuiyoha kusang'hana usang'hano ng'hani kwaviya vinhu vake havikala. Kezasegela bila chinhu fana viyezile bila chinhu. Mbuli ino iha ng'hani. <verse eid="ECC 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />Siku zose kakala muna diziza na lugano, muna yamagayo na mitamu.<verse eid="ECC 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Baho niwona kuwa vinoga munhu yaje na yang'we na yadeng'helele sang'hano yake iyosang'hana muna iisi siku izo ndodo zoyeng'higwe na Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya ivo viyekiligwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />One Mulungu yahamwing'ha munhu utajili na vinhu vingi na kumtenda yadeng'helele vinhu vake, munhu iyo yalave hewela na yadeng'helele voyapatile kwa vuke jake. Mbuli izo zose chitumetume chilawa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Mulungu kamtenda yadeng'helele, ivo hezakuwa na lugano muna zisiku za ugima wake.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Niwona mbuli ihile imwe hano hana iisi, iyo iwadidimiza wanhu. <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Mulungu komwing'ha munhu utajili na hishima muladi sekeyapuwe chinhu chochose choyolonda. Mbali hamuleka yavideng'helele vinhu ivo kuno munhu imwenga komweda vinhu ivo. Mbuli izo zokwazaganya na ziha ng'hani.<verse eid="ECC 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Munhu yahadaha kweleka wana gana na yahakala siku nyingi, mbali hadeng'helela ugima wake na hawandigwa kwa hishima, lelo nolonga muhavu mwana yavumbuke kadanganika kufosa munhu iyo. <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />Mwana iyo yadanganike hapata chochose kwa kwelekigwa kwake, iviya kokwagila muna diziza na kozimizigwa. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />Hawonile zuwa na hamanyile chinhu chochose, mwana iyo kohumula kufosa munhu iyo. <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />Ingawa munhu iyo kezakala miyaka elufu mbili, hadeng'helela ugima wake, lelo kalinga fana mwana iyo. Wose waidi wohita kumwe.<verse eid="ECC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />Wanhu wosang'hana usang'hano muladi kupata ndiya, mbali chila siku wowona nzala. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Vino wanhu wabala wana muhavu ng'hani kufosa wabozi? Vino kuvimanya kukala goya komtazaze ngayengaye? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Muhavu kudeng'helela vinhu vochilinavo kufosa kulonda vinhu hachinavipata. Mbuli iyo yokwazaganya na ilinga fana kugwila mbeho.<verse eid="ECC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Chila mbuli ilawilila sambi ipangigwa na Mulungu na chila mbuli imulawilila munhu imanyika mwaka. Wanhu hawadaha kuihuma na Mulungu, kwaviya Mulungu kana nguvu kufosa wanhu. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Kulonga mbuli nyingi hakufaya na hakuwataza wanhu.<verse eid="ECC 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Vino yelihi yovimanya mbuli zimfaya munhu muna zisiku ndodo za ugima wake woufosa fana sisila? Vino yelihi yovimanya mbuli zondazilawilile muna iisi yahamala kudanganika?<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s">Ukweli wa ugima</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />Kuhishimigwa kunoga kufosa mavuta ya bei ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:1">Ivo nolonga kuwa siku ya kudanganika inoga kufosa siku ya kwelekigwa.<verse eid="ECC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Muhavu kuhita kuna indilo kufosa kuhita kuna didugila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:2">kwaviya yolondeka weli wagima wavimanye kuwa ifa yochigozela cheye chose.<verse eid="ECC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Muhavu kuwa na usungu kufosa kuwa na seko, kwaviya usungu wochitenda chikangale.<verse eid="ECC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Wanhu wabala wogesa mbuli ya ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:4">mbali wabozi wogesa madambwa muhala.<verse eid="ECC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Muhavu kuzumigwa na wanhu wabala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:5">kufosa kutogozigwa na wanhu wabozi.<verse eid="ECC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Kwaviya seko za wabozi zokwaga himahima fana miwa viitatalika muna umoto. Mbuli iyo yokwazaganya.<verse eid="ECC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Uvwizi womtenda munhu mbala yawe mbozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:7">na kuhokela lushwa komtenda munhu yaleke kugolosa imbuli.<verse eid="ECC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Muhavu kukomeleza sang'hano kufosa kuyandusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:8">yofunya umoyo kamweda kufosa yeli na magoda.<verse eid="ECC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />Sekeuwone ludoko himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:9">kwaviya ludoko lokala kwa wanhu wabozi.<verse eid="ECC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />Sekeulonge, “Habali lusita lwa umwaka lukala lunogile kufosa sambi?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:10">Kwaviya wanhu wabala hawauza mbuli fana iyo.<verse eid="ECC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Kuwa na ubala kulinga fana uhazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:11">chinhu chiwafaya ng'hani wanhu weli wagima.<verse eid="ECC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Ubala na hela vodaha kumkaliza munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:12">iyo niiyo faida ya kuvimanya kukala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:12">ubala wokaliza ugima wa munhu.<verse eid="ECC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Zigese goya mbuli ziyotenda Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:13">Vino yelihi yodaha kugolosa chinhu choyabandile Mulungu?<verse eid="ECC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Muna zisiku za kudeng'helela udeng'helele, mbali muna zisiku za magayo uyagese magayo yayo. Mulungu katenda wanhu wadeng'helele iviya wagaye muladi sekewadahe kuvimanya chinhu chondachilawilile.<verse eid="ECC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Muna zisiku ndodo za ugima wangu, niwona wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wodanganika ingawa wotenda mbuli zinogile, wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wokala siku nyingi ingawa wogendelela kutenda mbuli zihile. <verse eid="ECC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Sekeuigese munhu goya ng'hani na sekeuitende mbala ng'hani. Vino habali koinanga mwenyewo? <verse eid="ECC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Sekeuwe msede ng'hani na sekeuwe mbozi. Vino habali udanganike lusita lwako halunafika? <verse eid="ECC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Kolondeka uzindilile mbuli zose ziuzumigwe, kwaviya munhu yomtegeleza Mulungu kozindilila mbuli izo zose.<verse eid="ECC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />Ubala womtenda munhu mbala yawe mkulu kufosa watawala longo muna dibululu.<verse eid="ECC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Ukweli habule munhu muna iisi yotenda mbuli zinogile muhala siku zose na hatenda uhasanyi. <verse eid="ECC 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Sekeuzike muumoyo mbuli zose zowolonga wanhu, muladi sekeumuhulike msang'hani wako viyokuduwila. <verse eid="ECC 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />Weye mwenyewo kovimanya muumoyo wako kuwa kuwaduwila ng'hani wamwenga.<verse eid="ECC 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzahila ubala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Mbuli zino nizilinga kwa ubala. Ivo nilonga, “Niwe na ubala,” mbali nipotigwa. <verse eid="ECC 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />Vino munhu kodahaze kuvimanya ugima viwili? Mbuli ino yokwazaganya. <verse eid="ECC 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Mbali niilunga kuvimanya na kuzahila ubala, iviya kuvimanya usede ni ubozi na ubozi ni umbunye. <verse eid="ECC 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Muhavu kudanganika kufosa kuwa mbozi. Ubozi wounamata munhu fana muke yeli na moyo ulingile mtego hebu lwavu lwa kugwilila. Makono yake yozingiliza fana minyololo. Munhu yomnogeza Mulungu koinega nayo mbali muhasanyi kogwiligwa nayo. <verse eid="ECC 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Mbuli zino nokulongela niye Mpetaji, nigeza kuzimanya mbuli zino ugaluga. <verse eid="ECC 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />Nigendelela kuzahila mbuli izo, mbali sizipatile. Muna iwanhu elufu imwe, niwona mulume imwe munhu goya mbali siwonile hata muke imwe munhu goya. <verse eid="ECC 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Nipata mbuli iyo muhala. Mulungu kaumba wanhu wawe na hishima, mbali wawo wagesa kutenda mbuli nyingi zihile.<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Vino yelihi yalingile fana munhu yeli na ubala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:1">Vino yelihi yovimanya kufambula mbuli ino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:1">Kuwa na ubala kochitenda chihanga cha munhu chitelele na chisamhuke.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtegeleze mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Nolonga uzindilile lagilizo da mfalume, kwaviya kwiilaha kutenda ivo haulongozi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Sekeulopole kusegela haulongozi wa mfalume na sekeumbiduke, kwaviya mfalume kezatenda chiyolonda. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Kwaviya mbuli ya mfalume ina nguvu kufosa mbuli zimwenga zose. Vino yelihi yodaha kumuuza, “Weye kotenda choni?” <verse eid="ECC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Munhu yozindilila malagilizo kezapata faida, iviya munhu mbala kolumanya lusita lufaya na voilondeka kutenda. <verse eid="ECC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Kwaviya chila mbuli ina lusita lwake, ingawa wanhu wogaya ng'hani.<verse eid="ECC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Habule yovimanya mbuli yondailawilile hamwande. Vino yelihi yodaha kulonga mbuli zikwiza? <verse eid="ECC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Fana viya viili haidahika munhu kugwila mbeho, iviya haidahika munhu kukimbila ifa. Fana viya mtowang'hondo viyeli hadaha kuikimbila ng'hondo, iviya wihi haudaha kuwakombola wanhu woutenda. <verse eid="ECC 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Mbuli izo niziwona vinikalile nopelemba mbuli zisang'hanigwa muna iisi. Kuno munhu komtawala miyage na kumgaza.<verse eid="ECC 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu womdumba Mulungu wezadeng'helela ugima wawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Baho niwona wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wowandigwa. Wanhu wawo wakala wokwingila na kulawa muna ikaye ya Mulungu na watogoligwa muna dibululu diya dowatendile mbuli zawo zihile. Mbuli izo zokwazaganya. <verse eid="ECC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Kwaviya muhasanyi hatagusigwe hima hima, lekamana wanhu woilunga kutenda mbuli zihile. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Wahasanyi wotenda mbuli zihile miyanza gana na wogendelela kukala siku nyingi. Mbali novimanya wanhu womdumba Mulungu wezadeng'helela ugima wawo. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawezakongeziligwa siku zawo zili fana sisila, kwaviya hawamdumba Mulungu.<verse eid="ECC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Kuna mbuli imwenga yokwazaganya muna iisi, wanhu wanogile wotendiligwa fana viwolondeka kutendiligwa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile, iviya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wotendiligwa fana viwolondeka kutendiligwa wanhu wanogile. Mbuli iyo yokwazaganya.<verse eid="ECC 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Lelo niye nogesa kuwa munhu kolondeka kumweda, kwaviya hano hana iisi habule chinhu chinogile kufosa kuja na kung'wa na kudeng'helela. Zino izo mbuli munhu ziyodaha kuzitenda viyolava vuke siku za ugima wake ziyeng'higwe na Mulungu muna iisi.<verse eid="ECC 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Vinigesile muna umoyo wangu muladi nivimanye ubala na kulola sang'hano za wanhu hano hana iisi, nitola kuwa wanhu hawagona imisi hebu hawagona ichilo. <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />Wanhu hawazimanya sang'hano za Mulungu zitendeka muna iisi. Woiyoha kuzimanya mbali hawadaha. Wanhu wabala woigoda kuwa wozimanya, mbali kweli hawazimanyile.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wose wodanganika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Nizigesa ng'hani mbuli zino na nihelela kulamula kuwa wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile na wanhu wabala na sang'hano zowotenda zolangulizigwa na Mulungu. Habule munhu yovimanya kuwa kezatogoligwa hebu kezalekigwa. Hachidaha kuzimanya mbuli izo zondazilawilile hamwande. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Kwaviya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile na wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wose wodanganika, wanhu welile na wambule mwiko, wanhu wolava nhambiko na wanhu hawalava. Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wose wodanganika, ivo viili kwa waja woilaha na waja wodumba kuilaha.<verse eid="ECC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Wanhu wose wodanganika, iviya mizoyo yawo iha na wabozi siku zose za ugima wawo, maabaho wodanganika. Mbuli iyo iha kufosa mbuli zose zilawilila muna iisi. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Mbali wanhu wagima wang'hali wololela. Imbwa kokwehuligwa, mbali muhavu imbwa mgima kufosa simba yafile yakalile yodumbigwa. <verse eid="ECC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />Kwaviya wanhu wagima wovimanya kuwa wezadanganika, mbali wadanganike hawamanya chinhu, iviya hawezalihigwa kaidi na wezazimizigwa. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Viwakalile wagima walonda wanhu na wawehila wanhu na wawawonela migongo, mbali mbuli izo zose zimala. Hawezailumba kaidi kutenda chinhu chochose chochilawilila muna iisi. <verse eid="ECC 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Ukaje ndiya yako kwa kudeng'helela na ung'we divai yako kwa kudeng'helela, kwaviya Mulungu kautogola usang'hano wako. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Iyawale viwalo vinogile na kuiboboda mavuta mditwi siku zose.<verse eid="ECC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />Udeng'helele kukala na muke wako iumulonda siku ndodo za ugima wako ziyakwing'hile Mulungu hano hana iisi. Kwaviya kulungiligwa ivo muna zisiku za ugima wako na muna isang'hano yako indala. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />Chinhu chochose chondaulonde kutenda uchitende kwa kuiyoha, kwaviya uko kuzimu kuuhita kwabule sang'hano hebu kugesa hebu kuvimanya hebu ubala.<verse eid="ECC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Niwona mbuli imwenga hano hana iisi. Magalu wa kukimbila viwoihuma hawahuma na wene nguvu hawahuma muna ing'hondo na wanhu wabala hawapata ndiya na weli na nzewele hawapata utajili na wasomi hawapata ukulu. Mbali habule yovimanya mbuli yondailawilile hamwande na izalawilila zuwaki.<verse eid="ECC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Munhu havimanyile kezadanganika zuwaki. Fana viya somba viyokwenzeka muna ulwavu na ndege viyokwenzeka muna umtego, ivo munhu kopata hulo kwa kusinhukila.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubala unoga kufosa nguvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Iviya hano hana iisi niwona simwe dino da ubala na ninogeligwa najo. <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" />Kukala bululu dodo dili na wakaya wadodo. Mfalume yeli na nguvu kafika kudibululu na keka bumbila kulu da watowang'hondo muladi kuditowa bululu ijo. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />Muna dibululu ijo mukala na munhu imwe ngayengaye mbala. Nayo kadikombola bululu ijo kwa ubala wake, mbali hamwande habule yamkumbuke ngayengaye iyo. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Ivo nilonga, “Ubala wofaya kufosa nguvu.” Mbali mbuli za ngayengaye zokwehuligwa na habule munhu yozitegeleza.<verse eid="ECC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Muhavu kutegeleza mbuli za ugaluga za munhu mbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 9:17">kufosa kutegeleza nyangi za ubozi za mfalume.<verse eid="ECC 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Kuwa na ubala kunoga kufosa kuhuwila via va ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 9:18">mbali muhasanyi imwe kobananga mbuli nyingi zinogile.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli zimwenga zisonhela ubala na ubozi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Fana viya ng'honzi wafile viwolava vundo muna yamavuta yonung'hila goya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:1">niivo ubozi chidogo viwagiza ubala na hishima.<verse eid="ECC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Moyo wa munhu mbala womulanguliza kutenda mbuli zigoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:2">mbali moyo wa munhu mbozi womwagiza.<verse eid="ECC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Muna uugima wake, ubozi wake wowoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:3">wanhu wose wovimanya yeye mbozi.<verse eid="ECC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />One mtawala yahakukalikila, sekeuleke usang'hano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:4">moyo wako wa uhole wodaha kumbembeleza.<verse eid="ECC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Niwona mbuli ihile imwenga hano hana iisi, mbuli iyo yogaligwa na watawala. <verse eid="ECC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />Wabozi wokwing'higwa sang'hano za hishima na matajili wokwing'higwa sang'hano za chakachaka. <verse eid="ECC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Iviya niwona watumwa wokwela falasi na lusita ulwo watawala wogenda na magulu fana watumwa.<verse eid="ECC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />Munhu yohimba kombo kodumbukila umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:8">munhu yogwisa ng'huta kolumigwa na zoka diifisile umo.<verse eid="ECC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Munhu yosongola mabwe kolumizigwa nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:9">na munhu yotula ngodi kezapata setani.<verse eid="ECC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Nguvu nyingi zolondeka kwa munhu yosang'hanila nhemo haitwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:10">mbali yahawa na ubala kovimanya yatende choni.<verse eid="ECC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Zoka da muhawi dahaluma ding'hali hadinatumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:11">muhawi iyo hafaya.<verse eid="ECC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Mbuli za munhu mbala zomtenda yalondigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:12">mbali mbuli za mbozi zomnanga.<verse eid="ECC 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Mbuli zose ziyolonga mbozi hazifaya.<verse eid="ECC 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />Munhu mbozi kolonga mbuli nyingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:14">Mbali habule munhu yovimanya mbuli yondailawilile hamwande.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:14">Vino yelihi yodaha kumulongela mbuli iyo?<verse eid="ECC 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Sang'hano ya mbozi yomulegeza mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:15">ivo hakumanya koyohita.<verse eid="ECC 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Kwizagaya weye isi, mfalume wako yahawa mbwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:16">na walangulizi wako wahatenda dugila imitondo.<verse eid="ECC 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Kumweda weye isi, mfalume wako yahawa munhu wa hishima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:17">na walangulizi wako wahatenda dugila lusita lufaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:17">muladi wapate nguvu na sekewakoligwe na upele.<verse eid="ECC 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />One munhu yahawa mbwa, kaye yake yoseguka na yosulula.<verse eid="ECC 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Ndiya yomtenda munhu yadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:19">divai yomsangalaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:19">na hela yomtenda yapate vinhu vose.<verse eid="ECC 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Sekeugese kumduwila mfalume muna umoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:20">iviya sekeumulige tajili muna umoyo wako uhawa wiidumwe muna ichiheleto chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:20">kwaviya chidege chizahulika chiulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:20">na chizamulongela mfalume.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s">Voyotenda munhu mbala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />Lava ndiya yako kwa makono maidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:1">kwaviya siku za hamwande kwizaiwona kaidi.<verse eid="ECC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />Vinhu viulinavo uwagolele wanhu wengi viwe ngama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:2">kwaviya hudimanya hulo dondadilawilile muna iisi na kwizalonda kutazigwa.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Mvula yahakika, yotonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:3">mbiki uhagwila kusi hebu kasikazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:3">hanhu baho haugwile wizasigala baho.<verse eid="ECC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Munhu yoyose yolola koiloza mbeho hezahanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:4">na munhu yolola mawingu hezagobola.<verse eid="ECC 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />One hudaha kuvimanya nzila ya mbeho, iviya hudaha kuvimanya mavuha ya mwana viyokula muna iinda ya mami yake, ivo huimanya sang'hano ya Mulungu yotenda vinhu vose.<verse eid="ECC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Handa mbeyu zako imitondo na sekeuleke kuhanda ichigulogulo, kwaviya huzimanya mbeyu zilihi zondazote, ziya ziuhandile imitondo hebu ziuhandile ichigulogulo, hebu zose zizakota.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wabwanga na walala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Bung'hulo dinoga. Kudiwona zuwa vidilawa komtenda munhu yasangalale.<verse eid="ECC 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Ivo munhu yahakala miyaka mingi, yadeng'helele mbuli zose, mbali yazikumbuke siku zikwiza yahamala kudanganika, kwaviya zizakuwa zabule uhelelo. Mbuli zikwiza zokwazaganya.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />Weye mbwanga, deng'helela siku ziuli mbwanga, moyo wako usangalale lusita ung'hali mbwanga. Tenda chiugesa muna umoyo wako, mbali ukumbuke kuwa Mulungu kezakuhumiza kwa mbuli zose ziutendile. <verse eid="ECC 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Sekeudumbe chinhu chochose na sekeuyagese mawine yeli muna ulukuli, kwaviya uhawa mbwanga mbuli nyingi zofosa.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="s">Kumkumbuka Mulungu ung'hali mbwanga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />Mkumbuke yakulumbile ung'hali mbwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:1">zing'hali hazinakwiza siku zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:1">hebu hainafika miyaka yondaulonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:1">“Niye sideng'helela miyaka iyo,”<verse eid="ECC 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />ving'hali zuwa na bung'hulo na mwezi na nhondo havinagumigwa ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:2">lusita mvula viyokika.<verse eid="ECC 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />Siku iyo makono yokukaliza yezagudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:3">migulu yako itogile izagedageda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:3">iviya meno yako yezawola na meso yako hayezalola.<verse eid="ECC 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />Siku iyo nyangi hazizahulikika muna zinzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:4">iviya sindo za kudundila hazizahulikika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:4">wanhu wezalamsigwa na ndege viwolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:4">mbali madizi ya nyila hayezahulikika.<verse eid="ECC 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />Siku iyo kwizadumba kukwela uchanyha na kugenda muna dikulugumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:5">mibiki itangigwa milozi vondayalike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:5">mbalangulu wezakwiguta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:5">Wanhu hawezakuwa na hamu kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:5">kwaviya wolondeka kuhita kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:5">wanhu weli na ndilo wezafosa muna dikulugumbi.<verse eid="ECC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Mkufu wa hela wizakanhika na hamha ditendigwe na zahabu dizabeneka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:6">Nongo ya mazi izatulika muna disima na doo da kudehela mazi dizabeneka.<verse eid="ECC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />Matimbwisi yezabwela muna iisi kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:7">iviya muhe wizambwelela Mulungu yoyaulumbile.<verse eid="ECC 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />Mpetaji kolonga kuwa mbuli zose zokwazaganya, mbuli zose zokwazaganya ng'hani.<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpetaji kogotola kulonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Mpetaji kakala na ubala iviya kawafundiza wanhu muladi wavimanye. Kasoma na kaduganya masimwe mengi na kayandika kwa udahi. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Mpetaji kaiyoha kupata mbuli za kunogeza na kandika vinogile ng'hani mbuli za ukweli.<verse eid="ECC 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" />Mbuli za wanhu wabala zilinga fana balati da kudimila ng'ombe na masimwe yakunzagizwa na mdimi imwe ni fana miwa ikigwa goya.<verse eid="ECC 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Kufosa mbuli izo, mwanangu wiikalize. Kwandika vitabu kwabule uhelelo na kusoma ng'hani koulegeza lukuli.<verse eid="ECC 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Zihamala mbuli izo zose zilongigwe, kuna mbuli yolondigwa kulongigwa, muhuwile Mulungu na uzindilile ndagilizi zake kwaviya icho ichimu cha kulumbigwa wanhu. <verse eid="ECC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Kwaviya Mulungu kezachihumiza kwa vinhu vose vochitendile, mbaka vochitendile kwa kwiifisa, vinogile hebu vihile.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>